WEBVTT

00:00:07.510 --> 00:00:09.110
You use martial arts, too?

00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:12.120
Rijan taught you, didn't she?

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:15.780
That would make me your master's master.

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:17.690
Why Rijan?

00:00:17.690 --> 00:00:19.820
Why is her great-granddaughter your target?

00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:21.040
What is your goal?

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:24.670
Have you heard of the elixir of life?

00:00:24.830 --> 00:00:29.320
It's a miraculous drug of eternal
  youth and immortality.

00:00:30.070 --> 00:00:30.710
Could it be?

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:35.040
That's right. My desire 
is to become like you.

00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:37.470
An eternally young and immortal vampire.

00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:39.340
But unlike you,

00:00:39.340 --> 00:00:42.930
I was born a human with a limited lifespan.

00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:45.780
So, after much research,

00:00:45.780 --> 00:00:48.970
I've finally discovered how to do it.

00:00:48.970 --> 00:00:51.980
By consuming Ton's life?

00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:56.630
The livers of magic users invigorate me,

00:00:56.630 --> 00:01:00.620
and the liver of a blood relative 
is surely a good match.

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:02.080
Blood relative?

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:05.330
Rijan and I belonged to the same family,

00:01:05.730 --> 00:01:09.710
though I killed the rest of them.

00:01:09.970 --> 00:01:14.970
I see. You're the traitor 
brother Rijan mentioned.

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:18.750
I've eaten a few magic users so far,

00:01:18.750 --> 00:01:21.220
but they were of poor quality.

00:01:21.580 --> 00:01:24.770
They were only effective for a few years.

00:01:24.770 --> 00:01:25.850
You bastard.

00:01:28.130 --> 00:01:30.440
Looks like they've started, too.

00:01:30.730 --> 00:01:31.410
Ton.

00:01:31.830 --> 00:01:36.610
Then I shall entertain you with 
all the strength I can muster.

00:01:38.340 --> 00:01:39.450
Ken!

00:03:23.260 --> 00:03:27.260
<b>Episode 12 Shadows That Remain at Dawn</b>

00:03:30.990 --> 00:03:32.390
Shinyao!

00:03:32.660 --> 00:03:33.850
Shinyao!

00:03:36.910 --> 00:03:38.180
<i>What is that?</i>

00:03:38.180 --> 00:03:40.140
<i>A terrible power.</i>

00:03:40.140 --> 00:03:40.980
<i>Chris?</i>

00:03:40.980 --> 00:03:45.270
<i>It's hellfire that will 
destroy everyone you love.</i>

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:47.840
<i>Save her, Shinyao.</i>

00:03:47.840 --> 00:03:49.580
<i>Salvation. Salvation.</i>

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:53.540
<i>Salvation. Salvation. Salvation.</i>

00:03:58.010 --> 00:03:59.550
Shinyao, wake up!

00:03:59.550 --> 00:04:01.380
It's me, Ton!

00:04:03.960 --> 00:04:06.030
I'm counting on you, Wayne.

00:04:08.030 --> 00:04:10.100
Excuse the intrusion.

00:04:10.330 --> 00:04:14.110
Oh, good. Our diversion worked.

00:04:24.590 --> 00:04:27.370
The boy from the Twilights?

00:04:28.430 --> 00:04:30.620
Mr. Helsing. Are you all right?

00:04:33.340 --> 00:04:35.460
Did you come to stop the girl?

00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:36.300
Huh?

00:04:36.560 --> 00:04:41.960
Will you be carrying on my mission?

00:04:42.900 --> 00:04:44.680
Where's Mr. Backup's terminal?

00:04:49.250 --> 00:04:50.720
That's his terminal.

00:04:51.150 --> 00:04:53.350
It won't be easy to get in,

00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:58.160
but maybe you can.

00:05:08.020 --> 00:05:09.920
All right, Mr. Backup.

00:05:09.920 --> 00:05:11.560
Time for our final showdown.

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:19.460
I'd prefer to capture you alive.

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:23.710
I'd like to dissect you and discover 
the secret of your immortality.

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:26.050
You pervert!

00:05:30.230 --> 00:05:30.970
On!

00:05:36.020 --> 00:05:39.760
I see. Is this the result 
of your experiments?

00:05:39.760 --> 00:05:42.040
No, it's a failure.

00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:45.070
I'm simply granting it some of my life force.

00:05:45.260 --> 00:05:49.740
But it's more than enough 
to keep you busy for a day.

00:05:54.380 --> 00:05:55.950
Well, well.

00:05:56.270 --> 00:05:58.300
You're alive, doll.

00:05:58.300 --> 00:05:59.770
I am Toryu.

00:05:59.770 --> 00:06:02.590
Call me by my name, human.

00:06:02.900 --> 00:06:04.840
Toryu, you made it.

00:06:06.990 --> 00:06:08.940
I'm not the only one.

00:06:16.660 --> 00:06:17.890
Chris.

00:06:18.170 --> 00:06:19.990
Last but not least, there's me.

00:06:19.990 --> 00:06:21.940
Luke Bowen, strongest man in the world.

00:06:22.250 --> 00:06:24.190
Making his glorious return.

00:06:24.190 --> 00:06:24.860
Hey!

00:06:29.640 --> 00:06:30.660
Return.

00:06:33.190 --> 00:06:35.540
Luke. Guys.

00:06:35.760 --> 00:06:39.080
Chris saved us.

00:06:45.540 --> 00:06:46.280
Wake up!

00:06:46.280 --> 00:06:46.920
Ow!

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:50.630
I wouldn't call that saving.

00:06:51.570 --> 00:06:54.430
Luke's brother, how did you get here?

00:06:54.430 --> 00:06:55.350
I don't know.

00:06:56.340 --> 00:06:59.560
When I came to, I was crawling on 
the ground drinking muddy water.

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:02.040
They left me alive.

00:07:02.830 --> 00:07:08.150
A man becomes invincible and 
powerful to save the ones he loves.

00:07:08.420 --> 00:07:11.970
You've all got such incredible 
regenerative powers.

00:07:11.970 --> 00:07:14.530
This is why I envy Umbra so much.

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:17.940
Anyway, this place isn't 
big enough for all of us!

00:07:18.790 --> 00:07:21.480
Vlad, go to Lady Ton.

00:07:21.480 --> 00:07:22.770
But I—

00:07:22.770 --> 00:07:24.960
Stay out of this, vampire.

00:07:28.110 --> 00:07:30.910
We'll meet at Forbidden at dawn.

00:07:31.760 --> 00:07:35.280
Sure. We can drink a toast together.

00:07:42.300 --> 00:07:43.560
Shinyao.

00:07:58.860 --> 00:08:00.330
Shinyao!

00:08:14.140 --> 00:08:15.220
What is this?

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:16.960
What am I?

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:19.720
Help! At this rate, I...

00:08:20.020 --> 00:08:21.930
<i>What's wrong, miss?</i>

00:08:22.110 --> 00:08:23.850
Did you figure anything out, Wayne?

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:26.460
<i>I'm finally into the system.</i>

00:08:26.460 --> 00:08:29.690
<i>Mr. Backup's security is as tough as ever.</i>

00:08:29.910 --> 00:08:32.590
<i>Well? Think you can stop the system?</i>

00:08:32.590 --> 00:08:36.820
<i>I'm trying, but it'll take about
 30 minutes to shut down.</i>

00:08:37.400 --> 00:08:40.200
Thirty minutes? I won't last that long!

00:08:44.730 --> 00:08:49.960
<i>It's a gamble, but if you destroy 
the chip embedded in Miss Shinyao...</i>

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:52.590
Where? Where is it?

00:08:53.220 --> 00:08:54.930
<i>I don't believe it. It's on her neck.</i>

00:08:55.220 --> 00:08:56.020
Her neck?

00:08:56.020 --> 00:08:57.380
<i>Right on the back.</i>

00:08:57.380 --> 00:09:01.930
<i>Since it's located inside a bundle of nerves,
 they can control all her senses.</i>

00:09:01.930 --> 00:09:04.470
I can't aim for her neck.

00:09:08.870 --> 00:09:11.180
Well done lasting this long, Ton.

00:09:11.640 --> 00:09:12.650
Vlad.

00:09:16.730 --> 00:09:19.860
I won't ask you to let me handle the rest,

00:09:20.340 --> 00:09:23.100
but you should rest for 120 seconds.

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:27.710
W-Wait. Shinyao's just 
being controlled by them.

00:09:27.870 --> 00:09:30.460
I know. I won't fight her.

00:09:30.680 --> 00:09:31.370
What?

00:09:43.970 --> 00:09:45.810
No!

00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:47.210
Vlad!

00:09:53.810 --> 00:09:55.360
Vlad!

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:20.010
That won't work a second time!

00:10:20.270 --> 00:10:21.970
Here I come.

00:10:33.380 --> 00:10:35.280
Impressive, wolf.

00:10:35.500 --> 00:10:40.670
Your fighting spirit and toughness 
are both worthy of praise.

00:10:40.670 --> 00:10:43.340
But how long can you last?

00:10:43.340 --> 00:10:45.010
I'm just getting started.

00:10:47.380 --> 00:10:48.200
What?

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:51.510
Impossible.

00:11:03.790 --> 00:11:05.810
Shinyao.

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:15.480
Huh?

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:26.260
See? That's 120 seconds.

00:11:26.990 --> 00:11:28.240
Vlad!

00:11:30.470 --> 00:11:32.210
Huh?

00:11:32.490 --> 00:11:33.540
Shinyao.

00:11:33.540 --> 00:11:34.600
It's all right.

00:11:35.740 --> 00:11:37.440
She's been freed.

00:11:37.440 --> 00:11:40.300
There's nothing binding Shinyao anymore.

00:11:41.210 --> 00:11:43.470
She'll spit out all of it soon.

00:11:44.780 --> 00:11:46.120
I knew you could do it.

00:11:55.220 --> 00:11:58.690
I'm sorry. I won't be 
able to help for a while.

00:11:58.970 --> 00:12:03.000
It's fine. You've already helped so much.

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:05.660
You saved Shinyao.

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:19.460
Now I'll save you.

00:12:19.850 --> 00:12:22.740
I'm fine. More importantly...

00:12:23.910 --> 00:12:26.040
Save the world, Ton.

00:12:36.760 --> 00:12:37.900
Check it out.

00:12:38.120 --> 00:12:40.650
His regenerative abilities are failing.

00:12:40.870 --> 00:12:42.520
This is the end!

00:12:42.520 --> 00:12:44.200
How many times has it been the end?

00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:45.100
Now!

00:12:46.770 --> 00:12:47.350
Let's go!

00:12:47.350 --> 00:12:48.160
I'll do it!

00:12:48.320 --> 00:12:49.490
No, me!

00:13:04.410 --> 00:13:07.640
Sorry that all I can do is fight.

00:13:08.380 --> 00:13:10.710
I've failed as a member of the Twilights.

00:13:11.610 --> 00:13:14.630
But the next time we're reborn,

00:13:14.630 --> 00:13:16.690
let's find a way we can live together.

00:13:17.560 --> 00:13:20.220
Go!

00:13:46.110 --> 00:13:48.950
I've lost 50 years,

00:13:49.430 --> 00:13:54.160
but I'll just go underground for another 
ten years and gather my strength.

00:13:54.160 --> 00:13:55.600
Next time...

00:13:59.760 --> 00:14:01.020
You...

00:14:04.190 --> 00:14:05.220
Could it be?

00:14:36.330 --> 00:14:36.960
Ton.

00:14:40.680 --> 00:14:42.870
You're doing better than I expected.

00:14:42.870 --> 00:14:44.190
Good for you.

00:14:44.470 --> 00:14:47.030
You came, Lord of Gluttony.

00:14:47.310 --> 00:14:51.160
And I see two delicious 
snacks in front of me.

00:14:53.300 --> 00:14:56.420
Don't eat their flesh. Just their power.

00:14:56.770 --> 00:14:58.300
All of it.

00:14:58.300 --> 00:14:59.310
Come on.

00:14:59.310 --> 00:15:02.080
You called me here just 
to eat some leftovers?

00:15:02.810 --> 00:15:04.840
Should I include myself, too?

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:07.460
I'd love that.

00:15:07.460 --> 00:15:11.250
But unfortunately, I'm only 
here for a few more seconds.

00:15:11.250 --> 00:15:14.160
I'll only be able to eat one.

00:15:14.160 --> 00:15:15.150
Just one, huh?

00:15:16.110 --> 00:15:19.070
The red girl or the black one.

00:15:19.070 --> 00:15:20.820
Eat Shinyao.

00:15:20.820 --> 00:15:25.000
Release her from the curse 
of her unwanted power.

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:28.350
You're sure you want her?

00:15:28.350 --> 00:15:31.220
After that, I'll pray.

00:15:31.220 --> 00:15:35.410
I've never heard of a vampire
 who prays to God.

00:15:47.910 --> 00:15:48.970
Vlad.

00:15:49.380 --> 00:15:51.030
Come home, Ton.

00:15:51.730 --> 00:15:53.300
To Café Forbidden.

00:15:53.820 --> 00:15:56.570
Come back to me.

00:15:57.600 --> 00:16:02.000
Vlad, if I stop being human...

00:16:02.930 --> 00:16:05.810
If it seems like I'm going 
someplace far away...

00:16:06.210 --> 00:16:07.190
You won't.

00:16:07.470 --> 00:16:12.450
Then you can make me yours.

00:16:14.470 --> 00:16:18.340
If you want, that is.

00:17:08.550 --> 00:17:09.790
Get to work.

00:17:09.790 --> 00:17:10.710
Are you trying to kill me?

00:17:11.150 --> 00:17:14.010
You've been unmotivated lately.

00:17:15.560 --> 00:17:17.590
What? Lately?

00:17:17.910 --> 00:17:21.850
Has Vlad ever been excited to work?

00:17:22.900 --> 00:17:27.460
Are you saying it's hard to feel motivated 
when our manager's not around?

00:17:29.080 --> 00:17:31.970
Hey, you're still not open?

00:17:35.040 --> 00:17:37.580
Wait, what's with the attitude?

00:17:37.580 --> 00:17:39.990
I knew you guys weren't suited 
to customer service jobs.

00:17:39.990 --> 00:17:42.440
Yeah, but... Right?

00:17:43.050 --> 00:17:46.070
We weren't hoping to see an audacious old man

00:17:46.070 --> 00:17:49.630
who spends hours at the café 
with a single cup of tea.

00:17:52.240 --> 00:17:54.240
I thought you'd say that.

00:17:55.950 --> 00:17:58.340
Um... good evening.

00:17:58.340 --> 00:18:01.430
Shinyao, we haven't seen you in a while.

00:18:01.430 --> 00:18:02.560
Has it been three days?

00:18:02.560 --> 00:18:04.530
What have you been doing?

00:18:04.530 --> 00:18:06.850
We miss you when you don't come every day.

00:18:07.260 --> 00:18:09.230
Don't be so willful.

00:18:09.230 --> 00:18:12.270
Lady Shinyao must be busy with school.

00:18:12.270 --> 00:18:15.780
What are you studying at college?

00:18:15.780 --> 00:18:17.570
Cultural anthropology.

00:18:17.570 --> 00:18:18.940
What's that?

00:18:18.940 --> 00:18:20.660
Something you'll never understand.

00:18:20.970 --> 00:18:24.120
I ran into her on the way here,
 so I brought her.

00:18:24.720 --> 00:18:27.960
After all, it's dangerous at night.

00:18:28.260 --> 00:18:29.200
I see.

00:18:31.780 --> 00:18:33.840
You seem down.

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:37.600
You really are weak-kneed 
when she's not around.

00:18:37.600 --> 00:18:39.670
Don't you say the same thing.

00:18:39.670 --> 00:18:41.320
It can't be helped.

00:18:41.320 --> 00:18:43.420
After all, Ton is...

00:18:44.880 --> 00:18:46.980
Sorry I'm late.

00:18:50.040 --> 00:18:51.900
Ton, come here.

00:18:59.570 --> 00:19:02.840
What time is it, manager?

00:19:05.960 --> 00:19:09.460
8:20 PM.

00:19:09.730 --> 00:19:13.960
That's right. In other words, 
you're 20 minutes late.

00:19:15.660 --> 00:19:18.370
I'm sorry.

00:19:18.910 --> 00:19:23.900
Listen, Ton. You may be an employee, 
but you're responsible for this café.

00:19:23.900 --> 00:19:28.730
As the café manager and a member 
of the Twilights, it won't do for you to be late.

00:19:29.510 --> 00:19:31.460
In the first place, 
based on your lifestyle, you—

00:19:31.460 --> 00:19:33.700
Shut up!

00:19:33.700 --> 00:19:36.280
Class just ran a little late.

00:19:36.510 --> 00:19:40.840
It's not a big deal, 
so why are you nagging so much?

00:19:40.840 --> 00:19:45.200
I don't want a lazy vampire 
to lecture me about my lifestyle.

00:19:45.420 --> 00:19:47.460
I'm not lazy.

00:19:47.460 --> 00:19:49.960
I simply enjoy spending my days idly.

00:19:49.960 --> 00:19:52.830
What is that, if not lazy?

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:56.500
I'm Bram Stoker's 
masterfully-crafted vampire.

00:19:57.070 --> 00:19:59.130
Mr. Chris is in Rome?

00:19:59.500 --> 00:20:02.580
Yeah. He's meeting Umbra around the world

00:20:02.580 --> 00:20:05.150
and trying to find what he wants to do

00:20:05.690 --> 00:20:09.930
so he won't be controlled by his hate again.

00:20:10.310 --> 00:20:13.100
That certainly sounds like 
his style of atonement.

00:20:13.270 --> 00:20:15.080
Hold on.

00:20:15.080 --> 00:20:18.730
He hasn't called me at all.

00:20:18.730 --> 00:20:20.960
You have absolutely no charm at all.

00:20:20.960 --> 00:20:23.360
I should've sucked your 
blood when I had the chance.

00:20:23.610 --> 00:20:25.060
No way!

00:20:25.060 --> 00:20:28.040
I'll never do your bidding!

00:20:32.940 --> 00:20:37.110
Enjoy this peace while it lasts.

00:20:37.990 --> 00:20:43.210
Although peace is also what we desire.

00:22:27.940 --> 00:22:28.990
Yikes.

00:22:29.460 --> 00:22:31.240
I'm totally late.

00:22:38.650 --> 00:22:41.340
What is it? Is something wrong?

00:22:41.340 --> 00:22:41.980
Huh?

00:22:42.400 --> 00:22:44.050
Is it your first time in London?

00:22:45.150 --> 00:22:49.720
Yeah. I'm visiting my aunt, but I got lost.

00:22:50.910 --> 00:22:53.560
You must feel so disheartened.

00:22:53.560 --> 00:22:56.310
I was in the same boat four months ago.

00:22:56.310 --> 00:22:58.410
This is a problem, though.

00:22:58.410 --> 00:22:59.810
I've got class soon.

00:23:00.880 --> 00:23:03.980
Oh, don't worry about me. 
I'll go to the police.

00:23:04.350 --> 00:23:05.190
I know.

00:23:05.660 --> 00:23:07.110
Go here.

00:23:07.780 --> 00:23:09.750
It's right down the street.

00:23:11.030 --> 00:23:14.580
It's a little unique, 
but some very considerate

00:23:14.580 --> 00:23:19.290
and dependable people will 
help solve your problem.

00:23:19.510 --> 00:23:22.540
Café Forbidden?

00:23:22.730 --> 00:23:26.490
It's closed right now, but knock on the door.

00:23:26.490 --> 00:23:27.760
See you later.

00:23:28.530 --> 00:23:31.450
Thank you, miss.

00:23:35.160 --> 00:23:37.770
Take care, Baileu Ton.

00:23:38.300 --> 00:23:39.990
The other me.
